<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Kharam Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Rome</para>
  <para style="toc1">ROME Mi-ngaidiang Paul Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rome</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROME</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mi-ngaidiang Paul Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">Rome mi-ngaidiang larik hi tirton Paul in Jisu Christa inneisuoli 54-58 kum suungnga inmajia larik eii. Paul in Rome ma laleisimak, khawajarra hiwa chemajiahi Rome ma kaom Jihudi khat-um Jihudi ka-emak Christian ngai minchu mindik nasik-ah ileiminchoi chemajia kha eii. Hiwa chemajiahi ama'n Corinthna aomlaiya ileimajia chemajia kha eii. Khawajarra Paul in hiwa amajia nachu, phung rakip Jisu Christa kha ngamna rasu khat-um juirasu tia imajia kha eii (16:26).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ro­me mi-ngaidiang Paul chemajia larik hi Christian rakip sik-ah amun rakip-ah khat-um apha rakip sik-ah arei kaom kha eii, ajarchu Paul in angtuk incheenna khat-um katha tak-ah sanminring nahi Jisu Christa makheiya nimumator tia namalarpi. Halli Paul in Jisu Christa chongkahoi kha Inzootna Maruo le naminjompi. Kasing kathei angjet in murruolsiak inthoa larik-ah arei kaomkhet alam khachu 1:16 eii, hinthoa injia, “Kei'n chongkahoi sik bit-ah injak mong, ajarchu hiwahi sanminringna munasik ah ka-ngamna mirakip sik-ah chu Pathian ranak kha eii, mansakhet ah Jihudi ngaisik halli zaatlop ngai sik um eii.” Rome (1-12) Mainsakhet khoithenna kha Pathian jarra inthuukthei eii, halli inni huuina khoithenna (13-15) hichu Christian ringkho-ah chuon tak-ah thosik minchuna angjet inchel kha eii.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul in chemajia hi inphut na-ah mainsa khet-ah atheinuo-ah inrilsuok halli atudiangme inmajia tikha arilsuok <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ama'n miring ngai jarra khat-um Jisu Christa makheiya sanminringna nimuthei tia amajia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 1:16-11:36">1:16–11:36</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hiwasuoa Paul in chuontho angjet ah Christian ngai ringnalam minchunna kha aleipeii <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:33">12:1–15:33</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ama'n Rome koisuok suungnga kaom mi rakip diang inpaakna chong angjet ape-ah Rome larik hi minhek na anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ROM 16">16</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Christa Jisu suok, tirton khat-um chongkahoi karilsik-ah Pathian in ikadang khat-um ikoi, Paul kei'n kimajia eii.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Chong inthiangnga lei-injia angnga, akasootthei aphamatiang Chong kahoihi Pathian in ama chongkachoi ngaidiang makheiya chong inkhitna-ah ileipeii ejei. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Khawa khachu ama sapa eini Pumi Jisu Christa jarra eii, ama miring taksa sik-ah David phungrui makheiya injuonei. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Halli ama inthiang Pathian changna khachu ama'n ranak kaneitak-ah kathi makheiya ahongring nakhan amahi Pathian sapa eii tia anaminmujei. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Ama makheiya Pathian in kei kadiang Christa sikbeiya tirton enasik-ah anapejei, khawakhachu Phungli zaat mi rakip ngaihi ngamna khat-um chongkajui tiang lamkeinasik eii. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Hiwahi Jisu Christa mi enasik-ah Pathian in ikoisuok ngai karra Rome ma kaom nangni-um ning-incheljei.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Khawajarra Pathian in iminriang ama ami inthiang kachang sik-ah ikoi Rome ma kaom nangni rakip sik-ah kiheimajia eii,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Nipa Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa diang makheiya, riangwai khat-um kadai kha nangnidiang omrase.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minpaak nasik-ah Pathian Kani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Mansakhet-ah, Jisu Christa diangnga inphut nangni rakip sik-ah Ka Pathian kha kaminpaak, ajarchu nangni in-ngamna kha manmasituol rakip in innajetpi jei. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Pathian sapa chongkahoi karilna chungnga kamalung pumpuiya sepa katho, chong kadik karilna chungnga Pathian in sakhi eii, halli nangni rakip kana-ngaidon tihi Pathian in ajet. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Khale inruoiya Kei'n apha rakip-ah Pathian diang kanichak, Pathian lungdou e-inchu kahoitak-ah kei'n nangni koolla heiwa mator kate. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Ajarchu Ratha lamtiang rawaanhi nangnidiang napeya nangni kha naminngarnasik beiya kei'n nangni kha kanamuzootthei jei. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Khawa khachu, nangnili kei inngamna chungnga inkhat le inkhat nin-angrip tina malung insoknasik-ah kiril eii.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ule naingai, aleiilaak zaatlop ngai karra ratha kikhoom angnga nangni karra-um ratha kikhoomhi kamanuom. Halli kei'n nangni koolla woi-angjet heiwanasik-ah kangaidon, takkha hiwa thonasik-ah kathamak khat-in anakhan tihi ngaidonru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Chuon 19:21</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Ajarchu Greek li Greek ka-emak ngaidiang, kasing khat-um kamo ngaidiang halli hiwa mi rakip ngaidiang kei'n thodan kasuok loubaak kha kala-intuol. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Khawajarra kei'n Rome ma kaom nangni diang-um chongkahoi hi karilzoottheiya kaom.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongkahoi Ranak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Tichu, kei'n chongkahoi sik-ah injakmong, ajarchu hiwahi kangamna miring rakip in, sanminringna munasik-ah Pathian ranak kha eii, mansakhet-ah Jihudi ngaisik khat-um zaatlop ngaisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mk 8:38</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Tichu Pathian in mi ngaikha amale akadik kha angtho thoa amin-eme tikha chongkahoi in amalar, halli hiwahi inphutna makheiya insuona katung inngamna jarra eii. Chong inthiangnga inleimajia angnga, “Pathian diangnga akadik imin eii mi seng-in inngamna khan inringsik eii.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">inngamna dungjuiya Pathian diang kadik ah kaom in ringna aneisik eii, emakli Pathian diang kadik ah i-om dungjuiya inngamna ah aring sik eii.</char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Heb 2:4</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Manmasi ngai Thamakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Miringngai manu khat-um inthamakna rakip halli inmani dikmakna lamma akadik kha minjetmak nasik-ah kakhar kapeii inmani chungnga Pathian raangna kha marwaan makheiya ajuomalar jei. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Pathian in inmani kha arachaak, ajarchu Pathian jarra angme jetsik kasuok rakip kha inmani diang aminmu jei, halli Pathian tak-innum inmani diang inthiangnga inlarpi jei. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Pathian in Manmasituol abool laiya inphut ama diangnga nimumatormak kul ngai khachu, hektik kaboi ranak khat-um ama Pathian changna omchan ngaihi inthiangnga nimujei, halli ama ibool rakip kha inmani'n injet, khawajarra hiwa mi ngai'n inlitthei nasik iteii ommak. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Inmani'n Pathian kha injet innum, Pathian kha khoya leithomu khat-um inmani'n leiminpaakmu. Khawa rathuulla inmani ngaidonna ngaikha anemna kaboi lei-ejei, halli inmani kamo malungroon kha kaziing in leisipjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 4:17">Eph 4:17</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 4:18">18</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Inmani'n inti kasing kin-eii, takkha inmani kha ka-am khet inlei eii. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Akathi kaboi Pathian kha chubei intho rathuulla manmasi ngai kut-ah inbool kalathisik mi, wa emakli sa, emakli wonna intoot khouring ngai ramil kha chubei intho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Innidan 4:16-18</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Han, Pathian in hiwa mi ngaidiang inmalungnga inngaidon kathamak inthozoot kha thonasik-ah azootpijei, halli inmani karra jakna kaomthei chuon ngaikha intho. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Inmani'n Pathian jarra akadik kha maleiseiya inminthuul, angrakip kaboolpa Pathian kha chubei thosik rathuulla ama kutbool phur ngaikha chubei khat-um sepa intho, Pathian hi kumsoot-ah minpaak sik eii. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Ajarchu inmani'n hiwa inthojarra, Pathian in inmani diang jakna kaomthei taksa imanuom kha apeii, halli a-ngai dungjuiya numeisale pasal in inlopsik kasuok taksa lamma inlopmuwa tho-ngai ka-emak numeisa li numeisa inlopjei. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Hiwa angnga pasal ngai innum numeisale inlopsik kasuok kha inlopmuwa pasal li pasal inlop-ah tho-ngai ka-emak jakna kaomthei chuonkha inkhatli inkhat diang intho, khawajarra inmani'n akadikmak chuontho chungnga rahoi kasuok rachaakna kha inmujei.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Ajarchu khawa mi-ngai'n Pathian jarra kadik jettheina kha inmalungnga dasik-ah manuommu, halli Pathian in inmani diang malung kathamak ipe kha eii, khawajarra inmani'n thomaksik chuonkha intho. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Halli inmani diang kathamak rakip in asipjei, khawa ngai khachu, kathamak, kakaraam, omchan kathamak, kara-ot, mikathat, insuol-inkhal, maleisei karil, khat-um inhal in aleisipjei, halli mi kathamak-ah karil, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>khat li inkhat kathamak-ah karil, Pathian ka-enzootmak,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathian ka-enzootmak, mi khoya kathomak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian ka-enzootmak khat-um mi khoya kathomak.</char></note> mi khoya kathomak, atheinuoa inpaak, in-or, halli inliansak, kathamak thonasik-ah ka-entok, khat-um anu apa chong kajuimak, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>katha kase kajetmak, chong inkhitna kamakoi, mi ngaidiang minriangna li maritna neimujei, <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Halli inmani'n injet Pathian Dan in hinti, hinnakati chounkatho mi ngaikhachu kathi sik-ah rahoisuok, takkha inmani'n inmasonna inthobit ema-ah mi ngai'n hiwa chuon ngaihi inheithopha khannum inmani'n zootpina innei.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Chongtanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>E, suopui, nang in mi leiilaak ngaidiang chong natanbe? Tu na-e-innum mi leiilaak ngai chungnga chongkatan nang in inlittheina munutin. Ajarchu nang in mi leiilak ngaidiang chong natan phakhan inmani ithojek omchan kha natho jarra nang in natheinuo-ah kathamak ninpe eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Matt 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luk 6:37</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Takkha hiwa ka-ang chuon katho mi ngai chungnga Pathian chongtanna khachu, akadik dungjuiya eii tihi eini'n nijet. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Khat-um hiwa chuon ngaihi mi ngaidiang kathoa kaom halli chongkatanna kaom miring ngaidiang nangni'n Pathian chongtanna makheiya inlit kinte tia ningngaidonbe? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Emakli Pathian omchan katha'n nangkha malung thuulna sik-ah lam nakeiya om tihi ngaidonleiya Pathian malung kadaile deiraatna khat-um minriang kalok ngaihi iteii emak tia na-ngaidonbe? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Takkha nang malung min-ngarna li namalung nathuul zootmakna khan, akadik chongtanna khat-um Pathian raangna nikhuo inlarni khan nang in nathienuo-ah inchaak nasik nibool eii. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Halli Pathian in eini rakip diang nichountho dungjuiya nitum kha anape sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Minpkla 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Chongil 24:12</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Mi lekkhat in kathakha inthochak-ah inom, halli poina, kayana khat-um kathi kaboi ringkhuo ka-entok rakip diang Pathian in hektik kaboi ringkhuo kha apesik eii. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Takkha atheinuo sikbit-ah ka-entok, halli kadik kha zootmuwa kathamak kajui inmani diang, Pathian raangna khat-um kheella raangna kha inmani chungnga aom sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Halli kathamak katho mi rakipdiang poongnali insuina inlamusik eii, mansakhet-ah Jihudi ngaidiang halli zaatlop ngaidiang. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Takkha katha katho mi rakipdiang Pathian in poina, kayana khat-um kadai kha apesik eii, mansakhet-ah Jihudi ngaidiang khat-um zaatlop ngaidiang. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Ajarchu Pathian in mi rakipdiang in-angrip-ah chongtanna anei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Innidan 10:17</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Halli Dan omleiya manu katho mirakip in Dan omleiya inthi sik eii, khat-um Dan nuoiya manu katho mi rakip in Dan in chong atan sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Tichu Dan kajet mirakip in Pathian mit-enna kadik kha emu, takkha Dan kajui mi rakip diang kadik eii tia arilsuok sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Khat-um zaatlop ngai'n inmani Dan kha inneimak innum, Dan chuonkha ara-ngaiya Dan iti angnga angrakip intho inchu, khawa ngaikha inmani sik-ah Dan kha eii. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Khawajarra inmani'n inmalung suungnga injia Dan kha inchuonthoa inmalar, halli inmani malungnga katha kase jettheina ngaikhan sakhi in-eii, halli inmani malung suungnga ngaidonna khan angka-ang pha-ah rachaakna-um apeii halli inngaakthei na-um apeii. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Khale inruoiya kei iril chongkahoi dungjuiya khawa nikhuo nikhan hinthoa asuok sik eii, Pathian in Jisu Christa diangnga inphut mi rakip in ruuk-ah inngaidon kha chongtanna aneisik eii.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jihudi khat-um Dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Nangni'n ningtheinuo ah Jihudi kin-ei tia ning inkoi, khat-um nangni'n Dan khan in-ngaina ningnei, halli Pathian jarra ning in-or, nangnile ang ning eyame? <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Nangni'n ningjet Pathian in angme i-naminthozoot, halli nangni'n angme kadik kha kadangna sik-ah Dan makhaiya ning inchu; <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Nangni'n kamumak ngai kakeiruoi sik, khat-um kaziingnga kaom ngai sik-ah war kin-eii tia ningngaidon, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>halli kamo ngaidiang kaminchu, kajetmak ngai sik-ah karu, ajarchu ningni'n Dan kha singna theina khat-um kadik rakip sip-ah aom tia ning jet. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Nangni'n mi ngaikha ningminchu, halli ningtheinuo achu inchumakchu? Nangni'n ningril “Maruup maru” takkha nangni'n ning maruupbe? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>“Zool-inthai thomaru” kati nangni'n zool-inthai ningthobe? Kut-ah inbool ramil ningmatir, takkha nangni'n Pathian kajetmak biak-inn ngai makheiya ning maruupbe? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Nangni'n Pathian Dan ningnei jarra ning in-orpui takkha Dan kha ning makoiya nangni'n Pathian diang jaknakha ningheichoibe? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Chong inthiang in ati, “Jihudi nangni ngai jarra, zaatlop ngai'n Pathian kha inrilse. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa 52:5</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Nangni'n Dan kha ningjui inchu, wunkatan hi anemna om, takkha Dan kha ningmakoi inchu wunkatanmak khale in-ang. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Wunkatanmak mi'n Dan kha ajui inchu, ama'n wun kha aleitanmak innum inmani kha wunkatan eii tia leimak nuwabe? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Taksa-ah wunkatanmak ama'n Dan kha ajui-inchu nangni'n Dan injia kha ningneiya halli wunkatan ning e-innum, Dan kha ning makoi inchu nangni kha wunkatanmak ngai'n chong natanmak nuwabe? <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Han inthiangnga wunkatan ama kha inthiang Jihudi kha eii, taksa-ah wunkatan li putiangnga Jihudi ka-eii kati ngaikha Jihudi emu. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Khale inruoiya inthiang Jihudi khachu suungnga ka-eii miring kha eii, halli ama kha amalung suungnga wun lei-intan suosik jei, hiwahi Pathian Ratha chuontho kha eii, Danna injia khan enuni, khawa miring kha mi ngaidiang makheiya ka-emak Pathian diangnga inphut inpaakna amu sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Innidan 30:6</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Halle Jihudi ning eli zaatlop ngaineek-ah angkachang inliak thotheina ommame? Emakli wunkatan in angkachang anemna ommame? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Angrakip-ah inliakdoomma, mansakhet-ah Jihudi ngaidiang Pathian in chong karil sik-ah apeii. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Halle inmani lekkhat in inngamna mak inle, inmani lekkhat inngamnamak jarra Pathian ngamna kha aommak sikbe? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Etheinuni! miring rakip maleisei karil in-e-innum Pathian chu akadik esik eii, inthiang chongnga hinthoa injia angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Nang in chongnaril kaalkhan niril chongkha kadik eii tia naminmusik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">halli nang nadiang chong innatan phakhan nang in maneii ngerro.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Minpkla 51:4</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Takkha eini dikmaknakhan Pathian diknakha kheella mindang inle, ama'n eini rakip poongna nape kaalkhan eini'n Pathian khi dikmak nitisikbe? (Kei'n manmasi omchanna chong kiril eii) <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Etheinuni! Pathian khi kadik emak inle, ama'n angtho thoa manmasituol chong tanmaneii niame?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Takkha kei dikmak nakhan Pathian lurna kadik kha kei'n sepa katho-ah kheella kaminsaang inle, angjarra keihi tuun katung manu karoon inkhat ah chong i-natanme? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Khawakha e-inle, hintimak minnabe? “Eini'n kadik juona sik-ah kathamak kha thotui nitisikbe”? Mi lekkhat in hiwa tak-hi intiya kei kadiang noonkuung innapeya inaminjak! inmani kha mudan kasuok poongna kha inmusik eii.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi Kadik Tuiteii ommu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Halle eini'n angme nithosik? Eini Jihudi ngaihi, zaatlop ngai neek-ah nithana ommakbe? Iteii ommak!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zaatlop ngai neek ah nithana ommakbe? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">etei ommak! </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli zaatlop ngai neek ah kintha makna ombe? ommak niraja ah ni in-ang.</char></note> tichu Jihudi khat-um zaatlop eini rakiphi manu karoon ni-eii tia naminmujei. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Chong inthiang in iti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Kadik tuteii ommu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Minpkla 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">Minpkla 53:1-3</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Tuteii kasing ommu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">emakli atuteii Pathian chubei katho ommu<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Inmani rakip Pathian diang makheiya inlet wiakjei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">inmani rakip nemna kaommak in-ewiak jei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">miring inkhat um katha katho ommujei, inkhat um ommujei;<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Inmani chongkha thina kahun kathamak in sipjei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">inmani maleiya kathamak maleisei inrilna jei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">halli inmani'n maruultur ka-ang thina chongkha inmurra inmasuok; <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Minpkla 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:3">140:3</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>inmani baisuo ah khomaak samna khat-um kasethei chong in asipjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Minpkla 10:7</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Inmani kha minsenali mi kathat sik-ah innot; <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa 59:7-8</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Inmani insina rakip kamang kachaibit inthoa inleida,<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Inmani'n kadai lam kha jetmujei,<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>khat-um inmani'n Pathian chisik tihi inchumujei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Minpkla 36:1</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Tuunchu, Dan in ileiti rakip kha Dan nuoiya kaom mi rakip diang iti eii tia eini'n nijet, ajarchu mur rakip minril maknasik khat-um manmasituol mi rakip in Pathian chongtanna nuoiya omtheinasik eii. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Ajarchu Dan izoot chuon nitho innum Pathian maikuungnga tu inkhat um kadik min enuni, ajarchu Dan in ajar eya manu kha nihongjet. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Minpkla 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:16">Inphut 2:16</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngamna jarra Kadik Changna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Takkha atuunchu Pathian dikna kha Dan inchenleiya amalar jei, Dan khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai'n sakhi inchangjei. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Pathian dikna kha Jisu Christa diang inngamna jarra eii, hiwahi Christa ka-ngamna rakipdiang apeii, ajarchu Jihudi khat-um zaatlop ngaihi iteii inteina ommak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Mi rakip manu niroon jei, khat-um Pathian lur lianna ah inphut intaksam jei. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Manboiya inapeii Pathian riangwai khan ajar eya anakatanpa Jisu Christa diang mikadik namin ejei. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Pathian in Christa hi minpaamleiya kanathipi sik-ah anapejei, ama thisen sarna <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ama thisen na. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ama inpesuok na thina khan.</char></note> jarra ngamna kha niralaangsik eii. Ama'n hiwa ithohi Pathian kadik kha minmuzoot jarra eii, ajarchu ama malung inkeikirna khan akatheng manu nileitho rakip-ah narachaak makjei. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Pathian in hiwa ithochu atuunna pha-ah apumtak hi kadik ka-eii tia amalarna eii, halli Jisu kangamna mi rakip ngaikha akadik amin eii.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Halle angngame eini'n nin-orsik? In-or nasik i-ommak, halli angkachang sinadan name? Halle Dan nijui jarra be? Emak, takkha ninngamna dungjuiya eii. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Ajarchu Dan chuon katho elekleiya ngamna khan mikha anamintuun kha-ei tihi eini'n nijet. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Halle Pathian hi Jihudi ngai Pathian bitbe? Zaatlop ngai Pathian leii emakbe? Zaatlop ngai Pathian num a-eii. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Han Pathian chu inkhatbit eii, Jihudi ngaikha'n inngamna jarra amale kadik amin esik eii, halli zaatlop ngai kha-um hiwale in-angrip ngamna jarra akadik amin-ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Innidan 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal 3:20</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Khawakha e-inle ngamna jarra Dan kha eini'n i-teii ka-emmak nimin ebe? Khawakha emarase. Eini'n Dan kha kheella mincheet nasik eii.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Abraham ma Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Tiallaiya nipa Abraham in taksa-ah ilei intongpui jarra angme eini'n nitisik? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Abraham kha achountho khan akadik mi amin e-inchu, ama'n in-ornasik ajar aom, takkha Pathian maikuungnga chu etheinuni. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Chong inthiang in angme iti? “Abraham in Pathian a-ngamnajei, halli ama kha mikadik eii tia azootjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Inphut 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3:6</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Miring inkhat chuon atholi ama chounthoman kha kutchoi eii tia leinunu, takkha achuonthoman eii tia nilei. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Khawale inruoiya miring inkhat in choun inzeelmak halli ka-ngamnamak ngai kamintuunpi Pathian khachu kangamna inmani ngamna kha kadik eii tia azootpi. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Chuon inzeelleiya Pathian in mi inkhat kha kadik eii tia alei-inchu, mi kha rawaan katha eii tia David in hinthoa aleiril.<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Inchuontho kadikmak rakip i-ngaidampi ngai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Khat-um inmanu rakip i-ngaidampi ngaikha rawaan katha in eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 32:1">Minpkla 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 32:2">2</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Pumi'n inmanu rakip iteelpimak mi ngaikha rawaan khatha in eii!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Kha e-inle hiwa rawaan hi wunkatan mi ngaisikbit ebe, emakli wunkatan makngai sik-um emak abe? Khawajarra eini'n nijet “Abraham inngamna kha-um akadik eii tia Pathian in aleipi.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Kha e-inle angtik pha-ah ileipime? Ama'n wun tanmaklaibe emakli wun tansuoli ebe? Wuntan suoli emak, wun atanma-ah ileipi eii. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Abraham in wun tanma-ah Pathian diang i-ngamna khan, amahi mi kadik eii tia Pathian in azoot, nuk-ah Abraham in wun itan khachu akadik mi eii tia injetna raliim kha eii. Khawa kha'n ajar eya wun katanmak inlei e-innum Pathian in kadik eii tia izoot khat-um Pathian diang kangamna rakip ngai Pa kha Abraham ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Inphut 17:10</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Hiwahi'n Abraham hi wunkatan rakip ngai pa amin eii, halli Abraham in wun tanmak laiya ileiring ringkhuo khale in-angrip-ah Pathian diang kangamna rakip ngai Pa kha-um a-eii.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Chongkhit nahi Inngamna makheiya Nimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Abraham khat-um ama phungrui'n manmasituolhi inmanita esik eii tia chongkhit na-ah nimu kha Dan injui jarra emak, takkha inngamna jarra nimu kadik khan eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Inphut 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal 3:29</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Khat-um Dan dungjuiya karing inmani kha manmasituol phungrui in e-inchu, inngamna hi arei ommak khat-um chongkhit nahi-um anemna ommakjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gal 3:18</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Dan in Pathain raangna ajuochoi, takkha Dan ommakna achu Dan kamakoi omnuni.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Hiwale inruoiya chongkhitnahi ngamna-ah kajuo eii, khawa kha e-inchu chongkhitna'n Abraham phungrui rakip-ah Pathian manboi kutchoi eii tia inngamna apesik suok, Dan kajui ngaidiang bit ema-ah Abraham itho kangamna rakip diang um a-eii. Abraham hi Ratha lamtiang einirakip pa kha eii. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Chong inthiang khan aleiti, “Kei'n nanghi phung angjet ngai pa kinamin ejei.” Akathi kaminring halli kalei ommak phur kaminjir Pathian diang Abraham in a-ngamna jarra hiwa chong inkhitnahi ama diang ileipe eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Inphut 17:5</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Abraham in iteii inngamna sik ommak phakhan num, ama'n angamna khat-um arangaitui jarra “Zaat rakip Pa amin eii” chong inthiang in iti angnga, “Nang naphungrui rakip arsi ngai angnga kamintam sik eii. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 5:5">Inphut 5:5</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Ama'n kumrajakhat hongtung sik tiang, halli ama taksa kha kathi angnga aranak aleisuon innum, halli Sarah kha nai aleineimak pha khannum Abraham inngamna khachu leiminsiin mak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Inphut 17:17</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Ama ngamna khan ama kha leimathaanmak, halli ama'n Pathian chongkhitna kha lei-inngamsamna mak, halli ama ngamna kha ranak in aleikasuunna Pathian kha aleiminpaak. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Pathian in chongkhit na-ah itipi rakip kha alamintungsik eii tia Abraham in kacheet-ah aleingamna. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Halli Abraham inngamna jarra “Pathian in kadik mi eii tia alei.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>“Amahi Pathian in kadik mi eii tia ilei chonghi” atheinuo sik-ah ileimajia emak. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Takkha eini rakip sik-um lei-injia kha eii, Jisu eini Pumi kha kathi makheiya kahong ringnook ejei tia kangamna mi rakip diang um Pathian in kadik eii tia alei. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Khawajarra eini ngai rakip manu sik-ah ama kha kathi sik-ah apesuok jei, halli eini ngai rakip hi Pathian le kadik namin-enasik ah naminring pinook jei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:5">5</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Pathian le Kadik enasik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Atuunchu eini rakip inngamna makheiya Pathian le kadik namin eii, halli eini rakip in <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eini in nimu; eini'n nimu sik eii.</char></note>ni Pumi Jisu Christa makheiya Pathian diang kadai kha-um nimujei. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Christa'n einihi ngamna jarra hiwa Pathian riangwai hin anaheiruoi, halli tuun hiwahin eini'n niring, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">in orrui, eini in orrui</char></note> halli eini'n Pathian lurlianna ngamna khan eini'n nin-or eii! <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Halli hiwabit ema-ah <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">eini innum in orrui.</char></note> eini'n nipoong niraal kaalla-um rokrui, ajarchu kapoong karaal in deimatorna anapei, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>deimatorna'n Pathian zootna kha aheichoi halli ama zootna'n inngamna kha aheichoi. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Hiwa inngamna'n einidiang jakna naminmumak, ajarchu einidiang inapeii Ratha Inthiang makheiya eini malung suungnga Pathian minriang nakha anapeii.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Tichu eini'n thodan aleiommaklai khan, Christa'n aphakacha-ah Pathian kajetmakngai sik-ah anathipi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Han miring inkhat in mikadik inkhatsik-ah kathimatorhi kawaangthei eii, khawakha e-innum katha katho miring inkhatsik-ah atu ka-ang inkhat in thipi mator kacha aom. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Pathian in angtuk naminriangme tikha hinthoa naminmujei khawa khachu eini'n manu karoon nilei elai Christa'n eini sik ah nathipijei. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Khawajarra Christa thisen <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ama thisen khan, Ama inpeisuok na thina khan.</char></note>khan eini-ngai rakip atuunchu Pathian le kadik namin ejei, khawajarra eini ngai rakip Christa'n kheel kheella Pathian raangna makheiya anasan sikjei! <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Halli eini ngai rakip Pathian inhalpui mi nilei eii, takkha Pathian Sapa'n nathipi jarra eini rakip Pathian le inngeina nineinook jei, halli i-naminngei dungjuiya Christa ringkhuo ah eini ngaihi angtuk inkheella ringna naminmu sikme! <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Hiwabit ema ah, eini ngai rakip Pumi Jisu Christa makheiya Pathian diang rokna ninei. Ajarchu ama jarra eini rakip tuunchu inngeitheina nimujei.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam li Christa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Khawale inruoiya manu hi manmasituolla miring inkhat diang makheiya aheiluut, halli ama manu khan kathi aheichooi, ajarchu mi rakip manu inroon jarra, mi rakipdiang thina atungjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Inphut 3:6</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Khale inruoiya Dan hi napema-ah manu hi manmasituolla aleiom, takkha Dan leiom maklaichu manu hi anemna leimin-ommu. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Takkha Adam pha makheiya Moses pha katung mi rakip chungnga thina'n wai aleiroon, khat-um Adam in Pathian chongpeii ijuimak angnga manu kathomak ngaidiang-um manu'n wai aleiroon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adam hi miring inkhat kajuosik raliim ka-ang eii. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Takkha hiwa inni hi in-ang ripmu, ajarchu Pathian manboi kutchoi chu Adam manu ka-ang emak. Akadik kha eii, miring inkhat manu jarra miring angjet thina innei. Takkha Pathian riangwai hichu kalokdoom kha eii, halli Jisu Christa bit-in amankaboi Pathian riangwai kutchoi kha mi angjet diang apeii. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Halli Pathian manboi kutchoi li Adam manu hi inteina aom. Adam itho manu kha'n “Kathamak” chongtanna kha aheichoi, takkha manu angjet nileitho innum Pathian riangwai kutchoi khan eini ngaihi ama diang kadik mi namin eii. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Miring inkhat manu thojarra thina khan wai aroon, ajarchu khawa miring inkhat manu thojarra eii. Takkha Jisu Christa! miring inkhat bit in angme i-naleithopi chuonthoman kha angtuk kalokme, Pathian riangwai lokna khat-um amale leilamma kadik imin-ejei kamu inmani rakip in, Christa le inringkhuo ah wai inroonsik eii.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Khale inruoiya miring inkhat manu thojarra mi rakip manu katho amin eii, hiwale in-ang rip-ah miring inkhat kadik thojarra mi rakip kadik min-ena anei halli inmani diang ringna apeii. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Khat-um miring inkhat chongjuimak jarra mi rakip manu karoon amin eii, hiwale in-ang rip-ah miring inkhat chongjui jarra Pathian in mi angjet akadik amin esik eii.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Kadikmak katho insoonna sik-ah Dan hi aleibool, takkha manu insoon nakhan, Pathian riangwai kha-um kheella insoon sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Khawajarra, manu'n thina sik-ah wai aroon, halli Pathian riangwai'n kadik enasik-ah wai aroon, halli Jisu Christa eini Pumi jarra eini rakip hektik kaboi ringkhuo muna sik-ah lam nakeiruoi.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Manu ah Thina, Christa diangnga Ringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Halle, angme nitisik? Pathian riangwai kha kheella insoonna sik-ah eini'n manu kha apha rakip-ah nithosikbe? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Hiwahi etheinuni! eini'n manu ah nileithijei, angtho thoa manu ah laringtit minname? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Emakli, Christa Jisu diang Baptized kathojei eini rakip-in ama thina khanum Baptized nitho ejei tihi nangni'n jetmakchube? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Eini rakip Baptism nitho khan amale naphuum suom tina ejei, halli ama kathi kha-um nichansuo ejei, khawajarra apa lurlianna ranak in Christa kha kathi makheiya ihong ringnook angnga eini rakip-um akathar ringkho-ah niring matornooksik eii.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Han eini rakip-um ama'n ithi angnga amale pumkhat bit-ah ni-inchunjei e-inchu, Jisu Christa ihong ringnook angnga eini rakip-um nihongringnook nikhan amale pumkhatbit nila-esik eii. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Halli manu taksahi minmangnga, eini'n manu suok kha emaknasik, eini kamaruo ringkhuo kha Christa le inruoiya cross ah nithipuisuom jei tihi eini'n nijet. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Miring inkhat in athi phakhan, manu ranak makheiya namasuo ejei. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Han eini'n Christa le nithisuom inchu, Christa le inruoiya nihong ringsuomsik eii tihi eini'n inngamna ninei. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Khawajarra eini'n nijet Christa kha kathi makheiya hongringnookjei, halli woikhat-um thikhai nunijei, halli kathi in ama takchungnga wai roonnunijei. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Ama'n athi jarra manu khan ama chungnga wai roonmakjei, halli ama'n atuunna iring ringkhuo hichu Pathian diangnga iring ejei. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Hiwa angnga nangni innum ningtheinuo-ah manu khan ningthi ejei, takkha Christa Jisu jarra Pathian diang ningringjei.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Khawajarra akathisik nataksa chungnga manu khan wai minroonnook khaimaro, khawakha emak inchu kathamak kha nilamanuom eii. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Khat-um ningni'n ningpum saram rakip kha kathamak manu chuon thonasik peisuok maru, takkha ningni'n ningtheinuo-ah Pathian diang kathi ngai makheiya kahongring mi ngai ang-inlang, khat-um nangni saram rakip kha Pathian diang kadik chuonna inliingnasik-ah inpesuokru. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Khawajarra manu'n nangnidiang wai roonnunijei, ajarchu nangni kha Dan nuoiya ommak chujei, takkha Pathian riangwai nuoiya ning-om ejei.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kadik sik-ah Suokngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Halle angme? Eini'n Dan nuoiya ommak mijei, takkha Pathian riangwai nuoiya niom jarra eini'n manu kha nithosikbe? khawakha ethei nuni! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Nang natheinuo-ah miring inkhatsik-ah chong kajui suok inkhat sik napum kha na-inpesuok kaalkhan nijuipa suok kha nang na eii, nang in kathi kanapeii manu sik-ah suok na-ebe, emakli katha Pathian diangnga kadik kaheichoi chongkajui suok kha na-ebe. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Pathian kha minpaak om, tichu aphakhat ningni'n manu suok ninglei eii, takkha atuunchu nangnidiang kadik minchunna rakip kha ningmalung suungnga ningkeiluut jei. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Han nangni kha manu makheiya namasuo jei halli kadik sikbeiya suok naminchangjei. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Nangni'n taksa kasuol ning ejarra kei'n manmasi ngai omchan angnga chong karil, ajarchu apha khat-ah nangni ningpum rakip inthiangmak khat-um kathamak chuon thosik ah suok ning lei eii. Khawa angnga atuun chu ningpum raja-ah kadik inthiangchuon thonasik-ah suok sikbeiya inpesuok taru.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Ajarchu ningni'n manu suok ninglei elai, akadik khan ningle-nuomma namasuojei. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Takkha khawa phakhan ningni'n angkachang anemna ningmuwame? Khawa chuon ningtho jarra atuunchu jakna ningmujei, khat-um khawa rakip ningthoman chu thina kha eii! <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Takkha atuunchu manu makheiya namasuojei halli Pathian suok ning ejei. Halli hiwa anemnachu amadiang inthianghiaiya inpesuok sik eii, halli hiwa ningthoman chu hektik kaboi ringkhuo kha eii. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Han, manu chuon thoman chu kathi eii, takkha Pathian kutchoi khachu Christa Jisu eini Pumi diang makheiya hektik kaboi ringna kha eii.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Moiruoina ah Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ule nai ngai kei'n rilsik kitihi ningni'n suoilekleiya leijet ningte, ajarchu nangni rakip-in Dan jarra ningjet, khawa khachu mi rakip in inringlaiseng Dan in wai aroonsik eii. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Halli minkhina inkhat ah, aruothar kaom numeisa'n aringkhuo omlaiseng aruothar Dan in akhitsik eii; takkha aruothar thisuo inchu ama kha aruothar Dan nuoiya omnunijei. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Takkha aruothar ringpumma numeisa'n Pasal inkhatdiang inn anei-inchu ama kha zool-inthai tia inkoisik eii, takkha aruothar thijei inchu ama Dan makheiya amasuojei halli pasal inkhatdiang inn anei innum ama kha zool-inthai tinunujei. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Khawajarra ule nai ngai eini rakip um Christa taksale inruoiya Danna nithi ejei, halli atuunchu kathi makheiya karingjei ama mikha ni-ejei, khawajarra eini rakip Pathian chuonna arei kaom ni-esik eii. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Ajarchu eini'n taksa imanuomma nileiomlai, Dan khan nipumma chuon hongthoa taksa imanuom kha hongminngarra halli nitho ngai rakip kha thina ajuo inchang jei. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Takkha atuunchu eini rakip thina ka eii kanaleisur Dan makheiya nakatanjei, khale inruoiya eini'n Dan maruo-ah lei-injia kha sepa thokhai numinjei, takkha akathar Ratha lamkhan sepa nithosik ejei.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dan li Manu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Angme eini'n nitisik, Dan hi manube? Khawakha etheinuni, takkha Dan in ajar eya kei'n manu hi kijet eii, ajarchu “Ra-ot maru” tihi Dan in aleitimak inchu kei'n ra-ot tihi leijetnuning. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Suok 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Innidan 5:21</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Khale inruoiya chongpeii jarra manu'n aphakacha aleiya kei kadiang taksa manuomna ngaikhan namasok, ajarchu Dan inchenmak manu chu kathi kha eii. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Halli kei'n aphakhat ah Dan inchenleiya kaleiring, takkha chongpeii kha ajuopha khan manu kha honginsoonna aleiring, <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>halli kei kathijei. Halli ringnasik ka-eii hiwa chongpeii in kei kasik achu thina inchangjei. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Han, Manu in aphakacha aleiya chongpeii kha inliingna-ah kei kadiang maleisei katho namin eya, kei anathatjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Inphut 3:17</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Khawajarra Dan chu inthiang eii khat-um chongpeii hium inthiang, kadik halli katha kha-um a-eii. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Halle akatha kha'n keikading thina inapebe? Khawakha etheinuni! takkha manu kha eii akatha inliingna ah chuon katho, manu omchan kha inthiangnga manu eii tia inlarnasik chongpeii khan ajar eya manu hi hituuk kathamak manu eii tia anaminmu.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eini karra Inzootmakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Khale inruoiya Dan hichu rathalam eii tia eini'n nijet, takkha keichu rathalam mi emong, manu kathosik-ah innajuor suok ka-ang ka eii. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Halli kei'n angme kithohi kei'n jetmator mong, han kei'n kithozoot kha kei'n thomong, takkha kei'n kimatir kha kei'n katho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5:17</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Khale inruoiya kei'n kithozootmak chuonkha kei'n katho, hiwa tinachu kei'n Dan hi adik tia kazoot. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Khawajarra kei'n hiwa rakip kithohi kei itho ekhaimakjei, takkha kei kasuungnga kaom manu inamintho eii. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Halli kei'n kajet kei manu omchan jarra kei kasuungnga iteii katha kha ommakjei, halli kei'n kadik kha thonasik-ah kangaidon takkha kei'n thomatormong. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Tichu kei'n katha kithozoot kha thomatormong, khawa rathuulla kei'n kithozootmak kathamak kha kei'n kathojei. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Khale inruoiya kei'n kithozootmak kha kei'n katho inchu, kei itho emakjei takkha kei kasuungnga kaom manu itho eii.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Khawale inruoiya kei'n Dan chuontho kha kamu, itichu kei'n katha kathozoot kaalkhan kathamak kha keile inruoiya aom. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Kei kamalung sungnga Pathian Dan kha kamanuom. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Takkha aleiilaak Dan inkhat-in kei kapum saram rakip-ah chuon tho-ah kaom kei'n kamu, halli inmani'n kei kamalungnga kaom Dan khale inhalpuiya raal inthoa inom, halli kei kadiang manu Dan in nasurra kapum suungnga chuon inthoa inom. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Kei hi angtuk kahoimak mi ka emejei! hiwa kathi lamtiang kanaruoi taksa makheiya atu'n nasanring sikme? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Kei'n Pumi Jisu Christa diangnga inphut hiwa ngai rakip katho Pathian kha kaminpaak!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Khawajarra kei kamalungnga chu Pathian Dan suok ka-ejei. Takkha kei kataksa inchu manu Dan kha sepa alatho.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ratha ah Ringkhuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Han atuunna inphut Christa Jisule karingsuom mi ngaikha chongtansik ommak. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Ajarchu Christa Jisu makheiya ringna kanapeii Ratha Dan khan <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lakkhat ah ommak, lek khat in aom.</char></note>keihi thina khat-um manu Dan makheiya anamasuojei. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Taksa kha asuol jarra Dan in ithomatormak kha Pathian in athojei. Halli Pathian in manu kha minmang nasik-ah Asapa takkha miring omchanna ajuotir. Asapa kha manu minmang nasik-ah eini manu karoon miring omchanna aleijuo. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Khawajarra taksa imanuom dungjuiya kasi emak-ah, Ratha dungjuiya kasi einidiang kadik Dan in iminthozoot kha huui mintungphit nasik-ah Pathian in ileitho ejei. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Taksa lamma kasi mi ngaikha'n taksa imanuon lamma inring, halli Ratha lamma kasi mi ngaikha'n Ratha imanuom lamma inring. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Halli taksa sik-ah kangaidon mi khachu thina eii, takkha Ratha lamtiang kangaidon mi khachu ringna khat-um kadai kha eii. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Khawajarra taksa lungdouwa kasi mikha Pathian inhalna eii. Ajarchu inmani'n Pathian Dan kha juimua eii halli inmani'n inthiangnga jui-um juimatornunu. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Halli taksa lamma kaom mi ngai'n Pathian kha mintai matornunu.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Khale inruoiya nangni'n thaksa ah ringmakchujei, takkha ratha ah ningringjei, Pathian Ratha kha nangnidiang omjei keengnga, Christa ratha kaneimak miring kha Christa mi emak. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Khat-um Christa'n nangnidiang aom inchu, taksa kha manu jarra kathisik alei e-innum, kadik khan ajar eya Ratha'n <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ratha hi nangni sik-ah ringna eii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nang na ratha kha aring nook jei.</char></note> ringna anapejei. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Halli Jisu kha kathi makheiya kaminring Pathian Ratha kha nangnidiang om-inchu, Christa kha kathi makheiya kaminring Pathian ama'n nangnidiang kaom ama Ratha'n nangni kathisik taksa kha ringna apesik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Cor 3:16</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Tichu ule nai ngai eini'n loubaak nila-intuol takkha manu omchan dungjuiya karingsik loubaak kha emak. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Ajarchu ningni'n taksa omchan dungjuiya ningring inchu ningthi sik eii, takkha Ratha'n ajar eya nangni taksa chuonkha ningminthi inchu ringna ningmusik eii. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Khat-um Pathian Ratha'n inakeiruoi mi rakip chu Pathian sa ngai ning eii. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Ajarchu Pathian in nangnidiang Ratha inapekha suok enasik khat-um kachi omnasik enape emakjei. Takkha Ratha'n Pathian sa ngai anamin-ejei, khat-um Ratha ranak in Pathian diang “Kapa! kei kapa!” tia nikoi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GAL 4:5-7">Gal 4:5-7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gal 4:6</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Pathian Ratha'n eini Rathale injomma einihi Pathain sangai ni-eii tia sakhi nanchangpi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Ajarchu ama sangai ni-ele inruoiya, eini-um ama mingai'n changsik-ah ileidapi rawaan ngaikha eini'n nichangsik eii, halli eini-um Pathian in Christa sik-ah ileidapi rawaan ngaikha Christa le nichang suomsik eii, khawajarra eini'n Christa kapoong kha nideisuom inchu, ama lurlianna kha-um eini'n nichang suomsik eii.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kahongsik Lurna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Ajarchu atuunlaiya poongna nideihi eini diangnga anamalarpisik lurlianna khale minkhisik-ah rahoi kasuok emak tihi kei'n kangaidon. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Pathian sangai juominlar sikkha ama kutbool rakip in inngaakchak ah inom. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Han ama kutbool rakip hi arei kaommak khomaak inchangjei, takkha ama ama lungduochu emak, takkha Pathian lungduoa kasuokbit eii, kha e-innum inngamnachu aom, <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Inphut 3:17-19</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Pathian sangai ninglenuomma lurlianna khan nisuokhat chu kachuoiya kamangsik kutbool ngai hi-um tum inlachansik eii. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Tichu eini'n nijet atuunna pha-ah akutbool mi rakip hi nainei pha-ah kapoong angnga inkoiya kapoong indeiya inom. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Halli ama kutbool bit emu inkoiya chap-ah kaom eini rakip um Pathian mansakhet kutchoi Ratha kamumasa ni e-innum nimalung sungngachu nitheinuomma nichap-ah eini rakip hi Pathian sangai namin-enasik khat-um nipum rakip<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkha ah chu inchen mak </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Pathian sa-ngai anamin enasik.</char></note> nakatan nasik ningaak ah niom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2 Cor 5:2-4</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Tichu eini ngai rakiphi hiwa ngamna-ah ringna nimu eii, takkha eini'n nimit-ah nimu khabit ingamna nida inchu, khawakha kadik inngamna emak. Hale eini karra nimit-ah nimu phurkhan inngamna kada tu niomme? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Takkha eini'n nimumak phurra inngamna nida inchu, khawa sik-ah eini'n kadei karaat-ah ningaak-ah niomsik eii.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Khawa angnga Ratha khannum eini ranak suolpha khan kanasansik ajuo, khat-um eini'n angtho thoa Pathian nini sikme tia leijet makmi, takkha Ratha'n eini sik-ah rildan kaommak chongnga inguuiya Pathian diang nanipi. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Khat-um Pathian inchu eini rakip malungnga ana-en, khawa jarra nimalung suungnga Ratha i-ngaidon rakip-um ajet, ajarchu Pathian lungdou nuoiya Ratha'n mi rakip rathuulla Pathian diang ananipi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Khale inruoiya eini'n nijet angrakip sik-ah Pathian in ama kaminriang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">angrakip sik-ah Pathian in ama kaminriang </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chuon rakip akatha sik-ah asuok; larik lekkhat ah hithowa injia, Pathian kaminriang ngai sik achu angrakip hi akatha sik-ah kasuok eii.</char></note> khat-um ama arei kaom sik-ah ikoisuok inmani rakip ngai thanasik-ah chuon atho. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Khat-um Pathian in ikoisuok mi ngai khachu ama asapa ka-ang enasik-ah ikhoithensuo ejei, khawa jarra ama sapa kha kangamna ngai rakip karra mansakhet esik eii. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Khat-um Pathian in ikhoithen mi ngaikha ama'n akoisuok, ama'n ikoisuok mi ngaikha amale kadik amin eii, halli ama lurlianna kha inmanile minmusuom.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa Jisu jarra Pathian Minriangna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Hiwa ngai jarra angme eini'n nitisik? Pathian in eini sik-ah na-ngirpi inchu, atu-inme einidiang kana-indeipui matorsik? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Ama'n asapa takkha minpaamleiya eini ngai rakip sik-ah anapesuok, kha e-inle angjarra ama diangnga kaom phur rakip manboiya einidiang anapemak sikme? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Atu'n Pathian ikadang mi ngaidiang ka-emak noonkuung peniame? Pathian amatak innum inmani kha kathamak katho emujei tia imalar ejei. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Han atu inme, inmani kha kathamak noonkuung kapesik? Christa Jisu kha emak abe kanathipi kha, halli ama'n kathi makheiya ahongringnook ah Pathian changtiang aomma eini ngai rakip sik-ah nanipi! <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Halli einidiang atu'n me Christa minriangna makheiya kanakhoithen matorsik? Poongna, malungkase emakli narachaakna, wonkachaam, emakli sara, chikaom emakli thina inbe hiwa katho matorsik? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Chong inthiangnga hinthoa injia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Tichu nang nasik-ah keini'n chikaom thina kha apha rakip ah kin-intongpui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">keini ngaihi inthatsik keelngam angnga inna-ngaidon.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Minpkla 44:22</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Khawakha enuni, hiwa ngai rakip in eini kanaminriang ama makheiya einihi kamator ngai neek-ah intor ni-eii. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Khat-um kei'n inthiangnga inngamna kanei itichu kathi e-innum, ringna e-innum, Pathian tirton ngai e-innum, lairalaak waikaroon ngai e-innum, atuunna khangnga e-innum, kalahongsik khangnga e-innum, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>chungtiang ranak-innum, nuoitiang ranak innum, Pathian ibool khuoring rakip innum Christa Jisu eini Pumi diang kaom Pathian minriangna makheiya eini rakip hi iteii innum nakhoithen mator nunijei.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Pathian khat-um Ami ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Kei'n inthiangkha karil, keihi Christa mi kaei halli kei maleisei um rilmong. Halli kei kase katha kajet malunghi Ratha inthiang in naroon jarra kei maleisei karil emong tihi aminthiar <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>kei'n hin kati innum, kamalungnga poongna kalok khat-um hekdan kaboi malung kadonghi aom <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>kei kapum khat-um thisen hi kei kami ngaisik-ah, keihi inmani rakip sik-ah Pathian khumaak samna nuoiya, halli Christa makheiya nakhoithen mi kha-um kei ki-ehi kamanuom. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Tichu inmani ngaihi Pathian mi ngai in-eii, ama'n inmani hi asa sik-ah abool halli ama lurlianna kha inmani diang amalar, inmani diang ama inzootna chong<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">inzootna chong; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">chonginkhitna inhap.</char></note> kha abool, halli Dan kha inmani diang apeii, inmani diang kadik chubei kha aom, halli inmani'n akadik Pathian chong inkhitna ngaikha inmu, <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Suok 4:22</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>halli inmani ngaihi araming kasi inpu ngai phungrui makheiya inlei-eii, halli Christa hi manmasi taksa-ah inmani ngai phungrui makheiya eii. Ang rakip-ah wai kanaroon Pathian kha hektik kaboiya minpaak ru!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ang rakip-ah wai kanaroon Pathian kha hektik kaboiya minpaak ru!</char></note> Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Han kei'n Pathian chong inkhitna kha huui tungmakjei kiti emak, han Israel mi rakip hi Pathian mi emu. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Halli Abraham Phungrui sangai rakipkha Pathian sa emu. Pathain in Abraham diang ati, “Kei'n nang nadiang chong inkhitna-ah kinapeii dungjuiya Isaac makheiya nang naphung narui ngaikha namu sikjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Inphut 21:12</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Hiwa tinachu taksa-ah innei sangai chu Pathian <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">neisik kasuok mak naipang innei ngaikha eii. Hiwa ngai minkhina chu Abraham phungrui Ishmael makheiya innei ngaikha in eii, Ama sa Hagar makheiya innei ngaikha in eii.</char></note>sangai kha emu, hiwa rathuulla Pathian chong inkhitna dungjuiya innei sangai kha inthiang phungrui in-eii tia alei. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Han Pathian chong inkhitna kha hiwa chongnga aleibool, “Apha kachatak ah <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">apha kachatak ah; nangkumtiang atuun na pha ah.</char></note>kei'n kajuo kirnook sik eii, halli Sarah in sapasal inkhat aneisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Inphut 18:10</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Hiwabit ema-ah, Pa inkhatbeiya sapasal inni Rebecca in aleinei khawa khachu nipa Isaac phungrui makheiya eii. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Sa-inphir kha inneimakma ah, katha khat-um kathamak rakip inthomaklai Pathian i-ngaidon dungjuiya ikadang kha koimaknasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Inphut 25:23</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>Chuontho dungjuiya enuni takkha ama ikoisuok dungjuiya esik eii tia Pathian in numeisanu diang aleitipi, “Upapa'n naipangpa diang sepa athosik eii.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Chong inthiang in iti angnga, “Jacob kha kaminriang, takkha Esau kha enzoot mong. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 1:3">3</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Halle eini'n angme nitisik? Pathian khi kadikmak kathobe? Khawakha etheinuni! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Ama'n Moses diang aleiti, “Kei'n kiminriangzoot midiang kaminriang sik eii, halli Kei'n minriang kaom midiang, kaminriang sik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Suok 33:19</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Khawajarra angrakip ngaihi miring eini ngai nimanum li nithozoot jarra enuni, takkha Pathian minriang na nuoiya esik eii. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Khale inruoiya Pathian chong inthiang in Egypt rengpa diang ati, “Kei'n nangdiang reng kinamin echu kei karanak minmuna sik khat-um kei karaming manmasituol pumpuiya minthang nasik-ah kei'n nanghi kinabool eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Suok 9:16</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Khale inruoiya Pathian in iminriangzoot midiang aminriang khat-um ama'n malung iminngar pizoot midiang malung aminngarpi.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Raangna khat-um Minriangna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Takkha miring inkhat-in kei kadiang anatisik eii, “Hiwahi e-inle angjarra Pathian in kathamak noonkuung inapeme? Atume ama lungduo kakheet matorsik?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Takkha Pathian diang chong kasaankir nook sik-ah nang tu na-eme? “Angjarra hithowa ninaboolme? tia neipil beel in kaboolpa diang rakelmak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Beelkabool pa'n beelbool nasik dialdook kha alungduo-ah inliingna zoot reiya inlingnamak niabe, halli in-angrip dialdook khan beel inni abool sik eii, inkhat khachu kalur areisik-ah, halli inkhat khachu kalurmak areisik-ah inliingnasik eii.<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Hiwa kadik le in-angrip ah Pathian in i-ngaidon kha itho eii, ama'n aranak kha minmuzoot jarra araangna kha amalar, takkha ama'n minmang sik-ah iminsuuk raangna inchang, inmani diang ama malung daina kha aom. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Ama minriangna kamu sik mi ngai khat-um apoina kamusik-ah iminsuuk inmani diang, ama lurlianna ijuope kha malarnasik amanuom. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Khale inruoiya ama'n eini ngaihi Jihudi ngai karrabit inakoisuok emak, takkha zaatlop ngai karra-um inakoisuok mi ngaikha ni ejei. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Hiwa hi eii ama'n Hosea larik ah iti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Kei kami ka-emak mi ngaikha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Kei kami eii tia ‘kakoisik,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Kei'n kiminriangmak zaat ngaikha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">‘Kei'n kiminriang khet’ tia kakoisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>‘Nangni hi kei kami ngai emakchu,’ atina mun takkhan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">Inmani ngaikha karingchak Pathian sangai tia inkoisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos 1:10</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Halli Isaiah in Israel ngai jarra aleiril: “Israel sangai kha tuipui neeldi angnga intam innum, mi lekkhat bit kha eii asanringsik. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 10:22">Isa 10:22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:23">23</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Ajarchu Pumi'n nuoipil chungnga innottheiya khat-um ahekna chong atan sikjei.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Hiwahi Isaiah in katheng suo ah ileiti ka-ang eii, intor Pumi'n eini khang ngaihi lekkhat analeihooimak inchu, eini rakip Sodom nilei angsik eii, halli Gomorrah um lei-ang kacha ni-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel li Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Halle, angme eini'n nilatisik, Pathian le akadik enasik kathomak zaatlop ngaidiang ama'n inmani inngamna dungjuiya akadik aminchangjei. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Takkha Pathian le kadik enasik-ah Dan ka-entok Israel sangai khachu kadik mununu. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Khawakha esik eii? Ajarchu inmani'n kadik kha ngamnale inruoiya entokmu, takkha inchuontho dungjuiya in-entok, khawajarra inmani'n “Insuina lungnga insui ejei.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Chong inthiang in hinthoa lei injia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Enru, Kei'n Zionna lungkha kada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">khawakhan mipui ngai insuina sik-ah kibool eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Halli khawa lungpui'n inmani kha purna apesik eii.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Takkha amadiang kangamna inmani khachu malung kakoi omnunijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ule naingai, Israel mi ngai'n sanringna inmunasik kei kamalung in amanuom khat-um Pathian diang-um kanipi. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Ajarchu kei'n katimator, inmani ngaihi Pathian diang kacheet-ah chubei katho in-eii, takkha inmani'n Pathian diang inngai nakha katuun jetnatheina makheiya emak. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Ajarchu Pathian dikna kha inleijetmak jarra inmani imanuom lamkhan sinasik inlei-entok, halli Pathian dikna khan lei-inpesuokmu. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Christa'n Dan hi huui mintungjei, khawajarra ama kangamna mi rakip in Pathian le kadik amin ejei.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanminringna hi Mirakip sik eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Dan juina khan, Pathian diang kadik naminchang, tijarra Moses in aleimajia, “Dan chongpeii kajui mirakip in ringna inmusik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Levi 18:5</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Takkha chong inthiang dungjuiya, ingamna-ah Pathian le kadik namin eme tikha hithoa injia, “Nang in natheinuo ah inkelmaro, tume marwaanna kasisik?” (hiwa tinachu, Christa kha nikeithaak eii). <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Innidan 30:12-14</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Emakli hitho inlang inkelmaro, tume amongna kaommak khurra kalaluut sik? (Hiwa tinachu Christa kha kathi makheiya nihong minring eii). <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Khale inruoiya hiwa'n angme iti? “Pathian chongpui khachu nang nakoolla, nang namurra, khat-um nang namalungnga aom” hiwa inngamna chongpui hi eini'n nirilsuok. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Khale inruoiya Jisu hi Pumi eii tia narilsuok khat-um Pathian in amahi kathi makheiya hongminringnook tia nangamna inchu, nang ringna namusik eii. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Tichu eini inngamna jarra, Pathian le eini kadik namin eii, halli ni-inpesuok jarra eini'n ringna nimujei. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Chong inthiang in ati, “Atu ka-ang amadiang angamna inchu angtikseng injakna penunujei. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Khale inruoiya Jihudi li zaatlop tia thenkhoi nuni, ajarchu Pathian chu mi rakip ngai Pumi eii halli amadiang kakoi mi rakip diang katamma rawaan apeii. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Chong inthiang in iti angnga, “Pumi raming kakoi mi rakip in ringna inmusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 2:32">Jer 2:32</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Takkha angtho thoa inmani'n inngamna neileiya amadiang sanna sik-ah koinuwame? Halli angtho thoa inmani'n inngamna munuwame, inmani'n ama chongkha inlara-ngai mak inle? Khat-um ama chongkha niril mak inle angtho thoa inmani'n jetnuwame? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Halle chongkahoi kha karilsik mi tirlekleiya angtho thoa inmani'n chongkahoi kha rilnuwame? chong inthang in iti angnga, “Angtuk enzoot kaomme chongkahoi inchoiya karilsik kaheiwa ngaikha! ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Takkha mi rakip in chongkahoi kha leikeiluut wiakmu, Isaiah in atheinuo-ah inti, “Pumi, tu'n keini ngai iril chongkahoi hi nakeiluut piame?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Khawajarra ngamna hi Pathian chong nirangai lia kaheiwa eii, halli Christa jarra niril lia chongpui kha kaheiwa eii.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Takkha kei'n karakel, inthiangnga inmani'n chongkha rangai muwabe? A-eii, inmani'n inrangai chu inrangai, takkha chong inthiang in iti angnga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Inmani rasa kha manmasituol rakip diang atung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">halli inmani chongngai kha manmasituol pumpui atungjei. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Minpkla 19:4</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Halli woikhat-um kei'n karakelnook, Israel sa ngai'n lajet matormube? Moses kha eii mansa khet-ah kanahong masang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Kei'n aleiilaak zaat ngaikha inliingna kata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">kei kami ngaikha kamin-ot sik eii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">halli akamo zaat ngaikha inliingna kata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">Kei kami ngaikha kaminraang sik eii. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Innidan 32:21</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Halli Isaiah in inngamna hiaiya ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Kei kana-entokmak mi ngai'n keihi innamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Kei kanarakelmak mi ngaidiang kei'n ka-inlarjei. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa 65:1</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Takkha Israel ngai jarra ama'n ati, “Kei'n suunsoot kakut inni kaduongnga chongkajuimak khat-um insuolkajong mi-ngai kadon sik-ah kaleiom.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa 65:2</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Pathian in Israel ngaidiang Iminriang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Khawakha e-inchu kei'n kanarakel, Pathian in ama mi ngaikha ahiaibejei? khawakha emak! Kei tak-um Israel mi ka eii, Abraham phungrui khat-um Benjamin phung makheiya ka eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Ajarchu Pathian in inphutna makheiya ikadang ami ngaikha kalekjuonmak. Takkha Israel ngai chungnga zootmak nakha, Elijah in Pathian diang nipina chong inthiang munkha nangni'n jetmakchube? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Pumi, inmani'n nang nachong kachoi ngaikha inthat halli nang maichaam inn ngaikha inthiatdar, keibit ka-ejei innada, halli inmani'n kei hium nathatsik-ah innaratok.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 19:10-14">1 Reng 19:10-14</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Halli Pathian in angkachang chongme amadiang ileimasang? “Kei kasikbeiya miring lising sari Baal pathian diang chubei kalathomak mi kalahooiya kada.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Reng 19:18</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Khawale inruoiya atuunna phale in-angrip ah, Pathian riangwai jarra ikadang mi lekkhat alahooi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Ajarchu ama kadangna kha riangwai dungjuiya amintha, inmani chuontho dungjuiya kadangmak, takkha Pathian kadangna kha miring chuontho dungjuiya amintha inchu, ama riangwai kha kadik riangwai enuni.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Halle angme? Israel miring ngai'n angme in-entok kha inmani'n mumujei, takkha rup kasiin mi lekkhatbit in Pathian kadang nakha inmu, aleiilaak sengchu Pathian koina makheiya inkuor inseetjei. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Chong inthiang in iti angnga, “Pathian in inmani ratha khat-um malung kha aminmo pijei, halli atuunlaiya apha katung inmani'n inmit mumujei khat-um inkuor kha aseetjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Innidan 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa 29:10</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Halli David in ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Inmani'n inbak in-in ngaikhan inkhit nasik chaang inchang tararase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">halli inmani kha kesuina khat-um rachaakna inmu erase! <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Minpkla 69:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:23">23</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Inmani mit ngaikha chorase halli inmani'n mukhai marasu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">halli inmani poongnakhan inruongkha hektik kaboiya inkun erase.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Halli kei'n karakel, Jihudi ngai'n insuina inneipha khan inmani'n mangnasik-ah insuina inneibe? Etheinuni! ajarchu inmani manu inthojarra, Jihudi ngai min-ot nasik beiya zaatlop ngaidiang sanminring nakha kajuo eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Han Jihudi ngai'n manu intho jarra manmasituolla rawaan katamtak ajuochoi, halli inmani Ratha tiang intasam jarra zaatlop ngaidiang rawaan katamtak ajuochoi, halle angtuk rawaan kalok esikme Jihudi miring rakip in puui tungnikhan.<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zaatlopngai sik-ah Sanminringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Khale inruoiya kei'n zaatlop ngaidiang kati, ajarchu kei'n zaatlop ngai karra tirton ka-elaiseng, kei kachuonna in-orna kaneisik eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Ajarchu kei kapumtak in kaphung kazaat ngai min-ot nasik kei'n kami ngai kibool eii, halli inmani lekkhat kha ringna minmu matorkate. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Khale inruoiya inmani ngaikha azootmak jarra manmasituol mi ngaihi Pathian le inngeina heichoi inchu, angkachang sikme, inmani azootpina khan? khawa khachu kathi ngaisik-ah ringna esik eii!<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Khale inruoiya mansakhet waipoollek kha Pathian diang nipe inchu, waipool pumpui kha-um amata eii, halli thingkung rajung ngaikha Pathian diang nipe inchu abaakngai kha-um amata a-eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Halli inna inling olive abaak lekkhat ngaikha akiakjei halli ramma kamoong Olive thingkuung bakkha khawakhan inminjomjei. Khawajarra nangni zaatlop ngai-um ramma kamoong olive thingkuung ka-ang ning eii, halli atuunchu ningni'n Jihudi ngai Ratha lamtiang jetna kacheet ringkhuo kha ningchan ejei. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Khawa jarra ningni'n abaak kakiak ngai ka-ang malung kakoi ngaikha mateekmaru, nangni'n angtho thoa ning in-or sikme? Nangni chu abak ngai ka-ang ning eii, ningni'n arajung ning iroon emak, arajung in nangni inaroon eii.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Takkha ningni'n hin ningti sik eii, “Abaak kakiak ngaihi keile injomthei nasik eii.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Hiwahi kadik kha eii, inmani kha inngam namak jarra inkiak suojei, takkha nangni'n nangamna khan ngirro, halli in-ormaro takkha kachi ero. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Halli Pathian in abaaktak ngaikha mathaanmak, nang-um namathaante tia na-ngaidonbe? <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Hiwahin eini'n nimu Pathian hi malung kadai um eii, khat-um malung kangar um eii; manu katho inmani diang ahal, takkha Pathian minriang nuoiya ning-om inchu, ama malung daina khan nangnidiang anaompui chaksik eii, khawakha emak inchu nangni um anakhai sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Halli Jihudi ngai'n inmani inngam namak kha inmathaan inchu, inmani'n in-omnasik munkhan amin-om nooksik eii, ajarchu Pathian in khawakha athomator. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Tichu nangni zaatlop ngai inna kamoong olive kuungnga abaaktak eleiya ramma kamoong olive baak kiakliya injom ngaikha ning eii, halli Jihudi ngai khachu innna kamoong olive thingkuung ka-ang in eii, halli kakiak thingbak kha akuungtak-ah woikhat minjom nooksik hi Pathian sik achu angtuk kabeime.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Minriangna kha mirakip sik-ah eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ule nai ngai nangnidiang hiwa kadik inthup chongngai rakiphi kei'n kana minjetzoot, ajarchu ningni'n angtuk ningsing ningthei mejei tikha anamin ngaidonsik eii. Israel ngai'n malung kangar kha kumsoot sikbit emak takkha zaatlop ngai'n puui katungnga Pathian diang inheikirna nikhuo katuungbit sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Halli Israel rakip sanminringna inlamusik eii. Chong inthiang in iti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Kana Katanpa kha Zion makheiya ajuosik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">halli Jacob tu-suon makheiya kathamak rakip ngaikha akhai sikjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Isa 59:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:21">21</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Halli kei'n inmani manu ngaikha kakhai suopha khan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">kei'n inmanile inzootna kaboolsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Isa 27:9</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Ajarchu chongkahoi kha inleizootmak jarra zaatlop ngai, nangni sikbit-ah Jihudi ngaihi, Pathian inhalpui mi in-eii. Takkha Pathian ikadang dungjuiya inmani inpi inpu ngai jarra, Jihudi ngaihi ama iminriang mi in-eii. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Takkha Pathian in woikhat ikadang khat-um rawaan ipe midiang, amalung thuulnookmak. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Hiwale inruoiya nangni zaatlop ngai, akatheng pha-ah Pathian chong leijuimakchu, takkha Jihudi ngai'n chong kajuimak in-e jarra, atuunchu ningni'n Pathian minriangna ningmujei. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Hiwale in-angrip ah, Pathian minriangna kha ningmu jarra atuunchu Jihudi ngai'n Pathian chongkha juimujei, khawajarra atuunchu inmani-um Pathian marit nakha inmu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat ah hiwa hi majia mu.</char></note> nooksik ejei. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Ajarchu Pathian in mi rakip diang aminriang nakha minmunasik-ah ama'n mi rakip chongkajui maksik-ah akhumjei.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian diang Minpaakru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Angtuk kalokme Pathian neinakha! halli angtuk inthuukme ama singna theinali jetnakha! Atu-me ama chongtanna karilmator? Atu inme ama lamkha kajet matorsik? <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa 55:8</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Chong inthiang in iti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Atume Pumi malungkha kajet?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Atume amadiang chong kaminchu mator? <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Ama'n pekirnooksik-ah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">atu'n amadiang phur inkhattak apeme?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Job 41:11</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ajarchu ang rakip ngaihi ama ibool kha eii, halli ang rakip ngaihi amasik-ah khat-um amadiang makheiya kasuok eii. Pathian diang lurlianna kha hektik ommarase! Amen. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Cor 8:6</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ringkhuo hi Pathian chuonthona sik eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Khawajarra ule-nai ngai Pathian minriang loknakha eini diang omjarra, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, nangni'n ningtaksa kha Pathian diang akaring dooiphur angnga inpesuokru, halli ama sepa kathosik-ah khat-um Pathian malung mintainasik-ah inpesuokru, hiwahi inthiang, khat-um Pathian izoot chubei katho ning eii. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Ajarchu ningtaksa kha manmasituol omchan kajui min-emaru, takkha ningmalung pumpui mintharnook inlang intei etaru. Khawakha e-inchu Pathian lungduoa angme ama athana, rokna, khat-um puui tungnakha jetjeiningte.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Khale inruoiya kei kadiang Pathian minriang kutchooi nape jarra kei'n nangni rakipdiang kanati. Nangni'n ning esik kasuok kheella ningtheinuo inliakdoomma inngaidonmaru, khawa neek achu Pathian in nangnidiang inape inngamna dungjuiya ning ingaidon khan malung kadaiya ningtheinuomma chong intanru. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Eini rakip pumma saram angjet aom, halli hiwa saram rakip ngaihi inchuonthosik inteiwiak. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Hiwale in-angrip ah, eini katamtak ni-e-innum eini rakip Christa le ni-inchun jarra taksa khatbit ni-ejei, halli taksa khatbit-ah saram angjet inom-angnga eini rakip um khatli inkhat ninjomwiak eii. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Han Pathian ama riangwai dungjuiya inape intei kutchoi ngaihi ni-inliingnasik suok, halli eini kutchoihi Pathian chong rilnasik e-inchu, ama innei ingamna dungjuiya inliingnarase. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Emakli sepa thonasik-ah e-inchu sepa thonarase, kaminchu sik-ah e-inchu minchurase, <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>emakli mi ngai kamasoksik-ah e-inchu ama'n masokrase, mi ngai arei kaomma kasansik e-inchu ama'n inpaam omlekleiya sanrase, halli lam kakeisik e-inchu ama'n katha-ah wai roonrase, minriang sik-ah e-inchu malung karok-ah ama'n thorase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-11">1 Cor 12:4-11</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Inrianghi malung inthiangnga esik eii, halli kathamak kha matirru halli angme kathakha mahuum chakru. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Christian ang-inlang malung karok ah inkhatli inkhat diang inriangru, halli miring inkhatli inkhat diang khoya inthozoot eru. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Kadool kha emaru, takkha huoikajuo eru, malung karok ah Pumi sepakha thoru. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Halli ning ingamna khan rokna naperase, poongna raalna-ah kadeikaraat eru, halli apha rakip ah Pathian kha niru. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Halli naneinaak kha, insamma kaom ngamna kanei mi ngai khale insempuiru, halli ning-inn kha khuolmi ngaisik-ah malongpiru.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Nangni kanarachak ngaidiang Pathian rawaan kha peru, halli inmani kha khomaak sammaru takkha rawaan peru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:44">Matt 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk 6:28</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Khale inruoiya karok ngaile roksuomru, khat-um kachap ngaile chapsuomru. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Halli mi rakiple malung inruolla omru, khat-um in-or maru, takkha nunchan inchuol mi ngaikhale inlopthei eru,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nunchan inniam kha zootro; halli nunchan inniam mile sap boolro.</char></note> ningtheinuo ah kasing kin-eii-tia inngaidonmaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 3:7">Chongil 3:7</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Halli atu ka-ang in nangnidiang kathamak innatho inchu inmani diang kathamak ah maleiinook maru, takkha mi rakip mit-enna katha kha thosik-ah ngaidonchakru. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Halli mi rakip le kadaiya ringtheinasik-ah angrakip ah ningmatorseng thoru. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Minriang kaom sappui ngai, phaphu lokmaru, khaneek achu Pathian in phaphu lokrase, ajarchu chong inthiangnga hinthoa injia, “Pumi'n ati, kei'n phaphu kaloksik eii, kei'n kapekir nooksik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Innidan 32:35</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Khawa rathuulla, chong inthiang in iti angnga, “Nangni ning inhalpui ngaikha inwon chaampi inchu, inmani kha minbakru, inmani kha intui raalpi inchu min-inru, hiwa ningthopi inchu inmani kha jakna kaomthei nipekha ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Chongil 25:21</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Kathamak in nangni kha namator marase khawa rathuulla, katha kha tho-inlang kathamak kha matorru.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Waikaroon ngaidiang Thosik chuonngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Mi rakip in wai kanaroon ngai chong juirasu, ajarchu waikaroon rakip ngaihi Pathian izoot nuoiya ikoisuok eii, halli atuunna waikaroon ngaihi Pathian izoot nuoiya in-eii. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Khat-um atu ka-ang in wai kanaroon ngaihi kajuimak mi khachu Pathian chongpe kajuimak in eii, halli hiwa katho inmani'n intheinuoa chongtanna innei sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Khale inruoiya katha katho ngai'n wai kanaroon ngaihi chisik emak, takkha kathamak katho ngai'n inchisik eii. Halli wai kanaroon inmani diang kachimak na-ezootbe? kha e-inchu katha kha thoro halli inmani'n nangkha innaminpaak sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Ajarchu inmani kha nangnisik-ah katha katho Pathian suok ngai in eii. Takkha ningni'n kathamak ningtho inchu inmani kha chiru, ajarchu inmani ranak inneikha, nangni ngai narachaak nasik eii. Halli inmani kha Pathian suok in eii halli inmani'n Pathian rachak nakha kathamak katho mi ngaidiang kapesik in-eii. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Hiwa jarra Pathian rachakna omjarrabit inmani kha nijuisik emak, takkha kasekatha najetna nimalung khan wai karoon ngaikha ningjuisik eii.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Khawajarra ningni'n rampar rakip ngai kha-um ningpe, ajarchu waikaroon ngai'n inchuontho huui inmintung phakhan inmani'n Pathian sik-ah chuon intho eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Matt 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mk 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk 20:25</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Halli angme ningni'n inmani diang ning intuol kha peru, halli ningni'n rampar ngaikha ning intuol inchu rampar ngai kha peru, ning karei rampar e-inchu kareiya peru halli khoya sik e-inchu khoya thoru, minpaak sik e-inchu minpaakru.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Khatli Khatdiang Chuonthosik Dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Miring khatli miring khatdiang minriang loubaak elekleiya, tuteii diang loubaak intuol maru, ajarchu atu ka-ang mi'n hiwa atho inchu Dan kajui eii. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Hiwahi Chongpeii ngaikha eii, “Nangni in zool-inthai thomaru, mi thatmaru, inruup thomaru, mi-ngai neinaak ra-ot maru” hiwa ngai rakip chungnga chongpeii inkhatbit in aminsuk wiakjei khawa khachu, napumtak ni-inriang angnga na-indiang inwaipui ngaikha minriangro.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-15">Suok 20:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:2">Innidan 5:2</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levi 19:18</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Halli mi ngaikha naminriang inchu inmanidiang kathamak iteii thonutin, itichu minriang tihi Dan rakip puui mintungna ejei.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Hiwahi nathosik eii, ajarchu kazaal makheiya intheipha ejei tihi nang in najet. Eini'n mansakhet ni-leingamna neek-ah atuunhin eini sanminringna phakha ajuoneijei. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Halli zaalpha hi thengdengjei, halli khuowar phakha aheitung dengjei, khawajarra eini'n kaziing chuonkha mathaantui halli kawar raalphur kha inluktui. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Han eini'n khuowar mi ngai ileeng angnga niomchan minthatui halli omchan kathamak, ju-inrui emui, kahur kakhiang khat-um zool-inthai emui, halli insuol inkhal emakli kara-ot emui. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Takkha Pumi Jisu Christa raalpuon kha inluktaru, halli manu taksa inmanuom chuonkha ngaidon khaimuru.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Mi ngaikha Chong tanmaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Ngamna kasuol mi ngaikha donru, halli inmani imanuom lungduokhan murruolsiak inthopuimaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Col 2:16</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Ajarchu mi lekkhat in inmani ngamna khan phur rakip bakwiak amincha, takkha inngamna kasuol mi'n anse suulpabit abak. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Khale inruoiya angrakip kabak mi'n anse suulpa kabak midiang mateek marase, halli anse suulpabit kabak mi'n angrakip kabak mi diang chong tanmarase, ajarchu Pathian in inmani rakip kha izoot eii. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Mi leiilaak suokngai chongkatansik-ah nang tu-na-eyame? Inmani karu in katha katho in-ebe emakli kase katho in-ebe tikha ama karu in chong atansik eii. Halli inmani kha katha katho in-esik eii, ajarchu Pumi'n inmani kha katha katho amin-e mator.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Miring lekkhat in nikhuo rakipneek-ah nikhuo inkhatkha kheella atha tia inngaidon, halli mi lekkhat in nikhuo rakiphi in-ang wiak tia inngaidon. Khawajarra mi rakip in ama ama ngaidon nakhan kacheet ah ngirrasu. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Nikhuo ngai rakip kaminlur miring in Pumi kayana sik-ah thorase, halli angrakip kabak inmani'n Pumi kayana sik-ah thorasu, ajarchu inmani'n Pathian kha inminpaak, halli angrakip kabakmak mi'n Pumi kayanasik-ah thorasu, halli inmani um Pathian kha inminpaak. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Ajarchu eini rakip in nitheinuo sikbeiya niring emak, halli eini'n nitheinuo sikbeiya nithi emak. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Eini'n niring hichu, Pumi sik-ah niring eii; khat-um eini'n nithi innum Pumi sikbeiya eini'n nithi eii. Khawajarra eini'n niring innum nithi innum eini rakip Pumi ta ni-eii. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Hiwa jarra karing khat-um kathi ngai Pumi enasik ah Christa in kathi makheiya ahongring nookjei. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Halli anse suulpabit kabak ningni'n angjarra ning-u ningnai ngaidiang chong ningtanme? Halli angrakip kabak ningni'n angjarra ning-u ningnai ngaidiang ningmateekme? Tichu eini rakip Pathian maikuungnga ngirnita ama'n chong nalatansik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Cor 5:10</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Khat-um chong inthiang in ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Pumi in ati, inthiangnga keihi karing Pathian ka eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">mi rakip in kei kamaikuungnga inbok inta chubei nathosik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">halli mi rakip in keihi Pathian ka-eii tia innarilsuoksik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Khale inruoiya eini rakip in ama ama chuontho kha Pathian diang nilapesik eii.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring inkhat Insuinasik Thomaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Miring inkhatli inkhat chungnga chongkatan datui, khatneek achu, nimalungnga ngaidon inlang mi ngai insuina emakli manu ah minchulnasik chuon thokhaimaru. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Kei'n Pumi Jisu le kaom suom jarra kei'n inthiangnga kajet, baksaak rakip iteii inthiangmak ommak. Takkha nang in baksaak lekkhat hi inthiangmak eii nati inchu, khawakha nangnasik ah inthiangmak eii. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Takkha nang in nibak ni-in jarra na-u nanai ngaidiang malung intooknasik e-inchu, khawakha minriang lamma nitho emakjei, nang nasaakbak in Christa in ithipi miring khatsik-ah mangna inchang marase! <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Halli nang in akatha-eii tia ningaidon khan kathamak-ah narilmarasu. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Ajarchu Pathian Rengram khachu kabak ka-in jarra emak, takkha Ratha Inthiang in inape kadik, kadai khat-um karok makheiya eii. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Khawajarra hinthoa Christa sepa natho inchu Pathian malung nimintaipi eii, khat-um mi ngai innum innazootsik eii.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Kadai khat-um <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eini'n ni-ngai don sik suok, larik lekkhat in inti, apharakip ah kinngaidon.</char></note> khatli khat ranak ngarnasik-ah kaheichoi lam ngaikhan eini rakip ngai'n kasongkaraat erui. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Halli Pathian chuontho kha nabak na-in nakhan minmang marase. Takkha baksaak rakip baksik eii, takkha miring inkhat manu minthonasik ajar e-inchu, i-ang inkhattak baksik kha kathamak eii. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Khale inruoiya nang na-u nanai ngai manu thonasik e-inchu meii ka-ei, ju ka-in emakli i-ang inkhattak baksik nithomak kha athawiai. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Khat-um hiwarakip na-ngamna jarra nangli Pathian kongkarra omrase. I-ang inkhattak sik-ah kazoot halli hiwa rakiphi kathamak emak tia katho mikha rawaan katha eii! <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Takkha ningni'n ning ibak rakip kha ning inngamsam inchu, ning ibak rakipkha Pathian in zootmak eii, ajarchu inmani chuontho kha ingamna dungjuiya emak. Halli i-ang inkhattak ingamna dungjuiya nithomak inchu khawakha manu eii.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Mi ngaikha Minriangro, Natheinuo ah Inriangmaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Inngamna-ah kacheet eini rakip in, kajeimak ngai phurrik roonmator nasik-ah nisansik suok. Halli napum khabit minhoimaro. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Khawa neek achu, eini rakip in ni-indiang inwaipui ngaikha inmani intha nakhan malung nimintaipisik suok, halli inmani inngam nakha niminsoonpi sik eii. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Ajarchu Christa in apumtak hoinasik thomak. Khawaneek ah chong inthiangnga lei-injia angnga, “Nangni diang injaknasik-ah innarilse ngaikha kei kachungnga juochuljei. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Minpkla 69:9</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Ajarchu angrakip chong inthiangnga ilei injiakha eini rakip ngai'n inchunasik-ah injia eii. Khawa jarra chong inthiangnga innaleipeii kadei karaat khat-um kamasok kha'n, eini rakip ngaidiang inngam nakha hong omte. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Halli deiraatna khat-um masokna kuung ka eii Pathian in hiwale in-angrip malungroon kha Christa Jisu omchan ningjui jarra nangni rakip chungnga malung inruolna omrase. <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>Khawa e-inchu nangni rakip ngai'n Pathian khat-um eini Pumi Jisu Christa Apa kha malung khatle rasakhat beiya minpaak nasik erase.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Chong kahoihi Zaatlop ngaidiang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Christa'n nangni kha i-nakeiluut angnga Pathian lurlianna sik-ah nangni-um inkhatli inkhat inngeiru. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Takkha kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Pathian hi kadik eii tia malarnasik, halli ama chong inkhitna rakip ngaikha inmani pile pu ngaidiang kadik eii tia minmunasik-ah Christa hi Jihudi ngai rathuulla suok ijuominchang eii, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>halli zaatlop ngai innum Pathian minriangna hi inminpaak matornasik-ah ijuo eii. Chong inthiangnga lei-injia angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Halli kei'n zaatlop ngai karra-um kanaminpaaksik eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">kei'n nang naraming minpaakna laa ngaikha kasaksik eii. ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 18:49">Minpkla 18:49</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Inlet ah ati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Rokru, zaatlop ngai, Pathian mi ngaile!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Halli inlet ah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">zaatlop ngai rakip, “Pumi kha minpaakru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Mi rakip in ama kha minpaakrui! ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Minpkla 117:1</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Halli inlet-ah Isaiah in atinook,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Jesse phungrui makheiya miring inkhat alajuosik eii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ama'n zaatlop ngai waikaroon ajuonooksik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">halli inmani'n amadiang inngamna indasik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11:10</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Ajarchu ningni'n amadiang ningngamna dungjuiya, ngamna juosuokna Pathian makheiya nangnidiang rokna khat-um kadai rakip kha siprase, khale inruoiya nangni ingamna kha Ratha Inthiang ranak in kheella naminsoonpi rase.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul in Ingamna hiaiya Amajiana jar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Kei ka-u kanai ngai, kei'n kajet nangni ngairakip katha in nasipjei, halli ningni'n singnatheina rakip kha ningneiwiak ah khatli inkhat diang ning indik matorjei. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Takkha kei'n malung inngamtak ah arei kaom lekkhat nangnidiang inmani jarra kamajia ah kanaminjetjei. Ajarchu riangwai khan ajar eya Pathian in kei kadiang <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Christa Jisu suok eya zaatlop ngaidiang chountho nasik anapeii. Halli zaatlop ngaihi Ratha Inthiang in ipeiluut Pathian izoot dooiphur min-enasik-ah kei'n Pathian diang makheiya chongkahoi karilsik-ah thiampu angnga sepa katho. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Halli keihi Christa Jisu le ka-inchun jarra kei'n Pathian chuontho na-ah ka-in-or mator. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Khat-um zaatlop ngaikha, Pathian chong minjuinasik-ah Christa'n kei kadiang makheiya chuon itho rakip ngai khabit kei'n malung kangar tak-ah karilsik eii. Ama'n hiwangai itho matorchu, chong khat-um chuon rakip ah, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>halli ngakkaom khat-um inlak ranak ah, halli Pathian Ratha ranak ngai jarra eii. Khat-um kei'n Jerusalem makheiya Illyricum rakip ah kaleisiya, halli kei'n Christa chongkahoi kha incheenna kaleirilthang mator. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Khawajarra miring inkhat in ileiphutjei chuonmun khan, kei'n chuon kajuotho maknasik, Christa raming kalajetmak mi ngaidiang, chongkahoi karilthangsik-hi kei'n apha rakip ah kimanuomkhet kha eii. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Chong inthiang in iti angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Ama jarra inlarilpimak inmani'n inlamusik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">halli kalara-ngaimak inmani'n inlajetsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa 52:15</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paul in Rome Sinasik ah Ilei-insuuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Khawa jarra kei'n apha rakip ah nangni koolla heiwanasik ah kana-ook inkhat aom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rom 1:13</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Takkha atuunchu kei'n hiwa ramsung rakip ah kachuon thosik kaminhekjei, halli kei'n kum angjet nangni namunasik karangaitui ah kaom. <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>Khale inruoiya atuunchu hinthoa kei'n kangaidon, kei'n Spain tiang kasina lamma nangni ngaikha, kana intongpuizoot halli nangnile inruoiya phabongkhat karok ah niomsuoli ningni'n Spain na sinasik-ah nasan ningte tia kangaidon. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Atuunchu, ang e-innum, kei'n Jerusalemma sikata Pathian kajet mi ngai sepa kajuothosikjei. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Ajarchu Macedonia li Achaia ah kaom koisuok ngai innum Jerusalemma kaom Pathian mi-ngai karra sara ka eii ngaikha sannasik-ah lailamma kutchoi pesik inleingaidon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1 Cor 16:1-4</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Halli khawa kathosik kha inmani'n inleirok, halli hiwahi inmani intheinuo ah inzootna eii, sara ngaidiang kasansik kha inmani chuon eii. Khawa jarra Jihudi ngai innum ratha lamtiang ka-eii rawaan kha zaatlop ngaidiang inleipei, khale inruoiya zaatlop ngai innum inmani diang taksa sik-ah arei ka-eii siallesum ngaikha Jihudi ngai sanna sik-ah inliingnasik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1 Cor 9:11</ref></char><verse eid="ROM 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Halli kei'n hiwa chuon rakip ngaihi kaminhek ah inmani diang hiwa siallesum rakip kaminmu phakhan, kei'n Spain na kasisik eii halli kei'n kaheiwana lamma nangni kha kanajuophasik eii. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Khat-um kei'n nangnidiang kanajuopha kaalkhan, Christa rawaan kasip khale inruoiya kaheiwasik eii tikha kei'n inthiangnga kajetjei.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ule nai ngai, Pumi Jisu Christa khat-um Ratha minriangna khan kei kasitbeiya Pathian kaniya napoongpui suomru tia kei'n nangnidiang kanani. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Kei'n Judea ramsuungnga kaom Pathian ka-ngamnamak ngai makheiya insuina ommak nasik khat-um kei kachuontho hi, Jerusalemma kaom Pathian kajet mi ngai'n innazoot pinasik-ah Pathian nanipiru. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Khale inruoiya kei'n Pathian lungdou e-inchu nangni koolla karok-ah heikirkate halli nangni le katharra roksuom nookrui. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Kadai Pathian kha nangni rakipdiang omrase. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Pumtak in Minpaakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kei'n Cenchreae koisuok inna sepa katho ni-nainu Phoebe hi, numeisa katha eii tia kei'n kizootle inruoiya kanapeluutjei. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Nangni'n hiwa numasanu hi Pathian kajetngai thosik angnga Pumi ramingnga keiluutru, halli ama'n nangni diangnga imanuom arei kaomkha sanru, ajarchu amahi mi angjet diang khat-um kei kadiang sapkatha numeisa eii.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Christa Jisu sik-ah kachuon thopuingai Priscilla li Aquila diang kei'n inpaakna kajuomathuon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Chuon 18:2</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Inmani'n kei kasik beiya inringkhuo leiminpaammu, khat-um kei'n inmani diang rokna kamalar, kei khabit emongnga zaatlop rakip koisuok ngai innum ratha rokna inheimalar. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Halli inmani innna kintuup Koisuok ngaidiang um rokna inheimalar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Asia ramsuungnga mansakhet Christa kangamna, kiminriang kasappui Epaenetus kha-um kei'n inpaakna kanei. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Nangni sikbeiya chuon kangar tak-ah kanathopi Mary diang um minpaakna kanei. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Khat-um mikhumna-ah keile kaomsuom Jihudi kasappui Andronicus li Junia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Junia, Junias, larik lekkhat ah chu Julia inti.</char></note> kha-um minpaakna kanei, halli inmani kha tirton ngai karra kheella aramingkasi mi in-eii, halli inmani kha kei neek ah Christians ka-e masa in-eii.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Pumi sik-ah kachuonthopui kiminriang khet kasap Ampliatus kha-um kei'n minpaakna kenei. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Khat-um Christa sik-ah kachuonthopui kiminriang kasap Urdanus khat-um kiminriang Stachys diang um minpaak kanei. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Christa diang kaomchak Apelles diang um minpaakna kanei, halli Aristobulus insuungkhurra kaom mi rakip diang um minpaakna kanei. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Jihudi kasapui Herodion khat-um Narcissus insuungkhurra Christian rakip um minpakna kanei.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Pumi chuonkatho Tryphaena li Trayphosa inpaakna kanei, khat-um Pumi chuon katamtak katho kiminriang kasapnu Persis kha um kei'n inpaakna kanei. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Pumi sik inkadang Rufus khat-um angrakip-ah keihi asa angnga kana-ngaidon anu kha-um kei'n minpaakna kanei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mk 15:21</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas, khat-um inmanile kaom aleiilaak Christian rakip kha-um kei'n minpaakna kanei. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Philologus li Julia, halli Nereus khat-um ama nainu, khat-um Olympas halli inmanile kaom Pathian kajet mi rakip kei'n minpaakna kanei.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Khatle inkhat diang inthiang inzoopna ah indonrui. Halli Christa koisuok rakip ngai'n inmani inpaak na-kha inhei mathuon.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Minchuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Kasapngai kei'n nangnidiang kanati, nangni'n ninglam rakip ah ning ijetjei minchuna makheiya intei ka-eii koithennali insuina kaheichoi inmani makheiya inringchakru. Halli inmani kha looiru. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Tichu khawa katho mi ngaikha Christa Pumi sepa katho emu takkha inmani'n wonkhopnasik intho eii, halli inmani chongkahoi yamli chongriltheina khan kamo malungkha kathamak ah min-ngamna innei. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Nangni'n chongkahoi ningjui kha mi rakip in innajetjei, halli hiwajarra kei'n nangni kha kanarokpui. Halli kei'n nangnidiang kimanuomchu kathasik-ah insingtheiru, takkha kathamak sik achu kamo eru. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Halli Pathian hi, akadai inthokna mun eii, halli ama'n nang nakeii nuoiya Seitan kha inottheiya ajuo toukanur sik eii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Pumi Jisu riangwai khan ningchungnga omrase.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekhat ah chu hi­mun­hin hapmu.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Kei kachuon thopui Timothy khat-um Jihudi kasappui Lucius, Jason, Sosipater inmani innum inpaakna najuopeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Chuon 16:1</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Kei Tertius ka eii, hiwa chongsem kamajiapa kei'n num Christian inpaakna kha kanajuo mathuon.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Kei ka-inntunpa Gaius ama inna koisuok kanaminchunpi ama innum inpaakna ajuomathuon, Khopuiya sappuipa Erastus, halli kinnai Quartus inmani innum inpaakna innajuomathuon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Chuon 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Cor 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Tim 4:20</ref> </char><verse eid="ROM 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Eini Pumi Jisu Christa riangwai kha nangni rakip diang naompuirase. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Pathian Minpaak nale Nina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Chongkahoi khat-um akatheng apha-ah kasoottak ah inthup ah kaleiom kadik kha chongmalar dungjuiya kei'n Jisu Christa jarra kaleiril, halli ama'n nangni inngamna ah kacheet-ah namin-ngir mator, khawa jarra eini'n Pathian kha minlur minlian rui. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Takkha atuunchu akadik kha Pathian chong kachoi ngai'n inlarra namajia pijei, halli hektik kaboi Pathian chongpe kha phungle zaat rakipdiang minmujei, khawa jarra zaatlop rakip in ngamna inte khat-um chongkajui e-inte.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Kasingkhet Pathian khabit kha Jisu Christa diangnga inphut hektik omleiya lurlian rase! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
